WEBVTT

00:07:59.792 --> 00:08:01.125
waiting to be told.

00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:04.143
Over the past few years,

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:07.601
there's been a fascinating
convergence of findings

00:08:07.625 --> 00:08:09.268
in several different sciences,

00:08:09.292 --> 00:08:14.351
in psychology and anthropology
and neuroscience and evolutionary biology,

00:08:14.375 --> 00:08:18.059
and they all tell us
something pretty amazing:

00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:23.351
that human beings have got
this massive capacity for altruism.

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:27.393
Sure, we all have a bit of selfishness
and greed inside us,

00:08:27.417 --> 00:08:31.750
but in most people,
those are not our dominant values.